part asks_a13
  tally 2
  note "A-13 · Had Ania stopped working (questions.md): as of 2024-12-31, known as of 2025-04-30. (a) is the scenario a13_jul, (c) a13_apr, both over a13_calc, the control layer that computes Kalina's and the SIO's 2023 from the payroll; (b) is a13_jul_sale, over a13_jul, whose lots are asked in its own file. A result is the tax less the advances: positive is payable, negative a refund. differs by: the figure in the scenario less the actual one (the world lis)."
  note "why: the diff lines (payroll by payer and payment month, 2023) show what the stop changes, against the control a13_calc; the control lines (a13_calc less lis) show what computing the payer years from the payroll changes by itself, which is 0 where the payroll gives the yearly information's figures."

